---
title: Node60 controlled power cycle (Architecture Rev C)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Parked: battery connected

    Parked: PARKED · TC10 sleep
    Parked: LM74910H-Q1 SLEEP (6 µA), nanopower LDO, LAN8670 VDDAU only
    Parked: ≈50 µA typical / ≈65 µA maximum, no logging

    Wake: WAKE
    Wake: PHY detects wake-up tone → INH high
    Wake: bucks ramp within 1 ms → S32K344 cold boot
    Wake: IRQ_N ready → PHY re-init → link up

    Run: RUN
    Run: all rails, MCU, PHY, flash, oscillator active
    Run: outputs off until configuration validated and commanded

    Shutdown: SHUTDOWN
    Shutdown: all six outputs off → flush log (≤8 ms)
    Shutdown: command PHY sleep → INH releases after tSLPINHDLY

    Parked --> Wake: controller ECU sends T1S wake-up pattern (only wake source)
    Wake --> Run: application ready (≈1 s accepted)
    Run --> Shutdown: controller "go to sleep" message
    Shutdown --> Parked: power tree collapses

    note right of Run
        Bus-idle timeout is rejected as a sleep source
    end note
